---
.title = "Read file line by line",
.date = "2024-01-01",
.author = "ZigCC",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

The `std.Io.File.reader` API reads through a fixed-size buffer instead of loading the entire file
into memory. It provides various methods such as `readAll` and `readInt`; here we use
`takeDelimiter` to split lines.

